["Which human action most directly reduces the ecosystem service of coastal storm protection?","clearing mangroves and filling coastal wetlands","restoring oyster reefs","protecting dunes with native grasses","Mangroves and wetlands absorb wave energy and store floodwater, so removing them weakens that regulating service."]
